  "releaseNotes": "- Fixed a bug for sleep breaks and maximum number of sleep breaks/route\n- Fixed a bug when using NotOnSameRoute in combination with cargo aggregation\n- Improved VehicleLoadBalancing.ReduceBigStopsOnDefaultVehicle when using stops with only one of volume or weight set\n- Fixed a bug where rest for driving was not taken if another break was following directly after\n- Improved driver breaks so that the earliest break is always taken first, which will affect later breaks",
